{
  "schema_version": "1.9.2",
  "id": "USN-9195-1",
  "summary": "libaacs vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that libaacs did not properly check buffer bounds when\nresolving symbolic links in Blu-ray disc paths. If a user were tricked into\nopening an attacker-controlled disc directory, a local attacker could\npossibly use this issue to cause applications using libaacs to crash,\nresulting in a denial of service, or execute arbitrary code.",
